{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ROM","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"罗马书","commonName":"罗马书","title":"罗马书","order":45,"numberOfChapters":16,"sha256":"9bcc884b0e342bd59c26ecf953bcd0a7ce0be56a44a95eee01272b5e756d0dd5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":16,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/16.json","totalNumberOfVerses":433},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["这样说来，犹太人有什么长处？割礼有什么益处呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["凡事大有好处：第一是 神的圣言交托他们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["即便有不信的，这有何妨呢？难道他们的不信就废掉 神的信吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["断乎不能！不如说， 神是真实的，人都是虚谎的。如经上所记：",{"text":"你责备人的时候，显为公义；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被人议论的时候，可以得胜。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我且照着人的常话说，我们的不义若显出 神的义来，我们可以怎么说呢？ 神降怒，是他不义吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["断乎不是！若是这样， 神怎能审判世界呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["若 神的真实，因我的虚谎越发显出他的荣耀，为什么我还受审判，好像罪人呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["为什么不说，我们可以作恶以成善呢？这是毁谤我们的人说我们有这话。这等人定罪是该当的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["没有义人"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这却怎么样呢？我们比他们强吗？决不是的！因我们已经证明：犹太人和希腊人都在罪恶之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["就如经上所记：",{"text":"没有义人，连一个也没有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有明白的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有寻求 神的；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是偏离正路，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同变为无用。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有行善的，连一个也没有。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的喉咙是敞开的坟墓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们用舌头弄诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"嘴唇里有虺蛇的毒气，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"满口是咒骂苦毒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杀人流血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的脚飞跑，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所经过的路便行残害暴虐的事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"平安的路，他们未曾知道；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们眼中不怕 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["我们晓得律法上的话都是对律法以下之人说的，好塞住各人的口，叫普世的人都伏在 神审判之下。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["所以凡有血气的，没有一个因行律法能在 神面前称义，因为律法本是叫人知罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["因信称义"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["但如今， 神的义在律法以外已经显明出来，有律法和先知为证："]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["就是 神的义，因信耶稣基督加给一切相信的人，并没有分别。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["因为世人都犯了罪，亏缺了 神的荣耀；"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["如今却蒙 神的恩典，因基督耶稣的救赎，就白白地称义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["神设立耶稣作挽回祭，是凭着耶稣的血，借着人的信，要显明 神的义；因为他用忍耐的心宽容人先时所犯的罪，"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["好在今时显明他的义，使人知道他自己为义，也称信耶稣的人为义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":["既是这样，哪里能夸口呢？没有可夸的了。用何法没有的呢？是用立功之法吗？不是，乃用信主之法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":["所以",{"noteId":3},"我们看定了：人称义是因着信，不在乎遵行律法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":["难道 神只作犹太人的 神吗？不也是作外邦人的 神吗？是的，也作外邦人的 神。"]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["神既是一位，他就要因信称那受割礼的为义，也要因信称那未受割礼的为义。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["这样，我们因信废了律法吗？断乎不是！更是坚固律法。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"-","text":"有古卷：因为","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":28}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ROM/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":31}